{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31970","headline":"送穆少府知眉州 · 贾岛","name":"送穆少府知眉州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劒门倚青汉，君昔未曾过。\n日暮行人少，山深异鸟多。\n猨啼和峡雨，栈尽到江波。\n一路白云里，飞泉洒薜萝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}